# Requests for the API, for the REST Client extension in VS Code.
#
# Install "REST Client" by Huachao Mao, start the API with npm start, then
# click "Send Request" above any request below. Check the status codes, not
# only the bodies.
#
@host = http://localhost:3000

### ---- Titles ----

### Browse all titles, most voted first
GET {{host}}/titles?limit=5

### Substring search in title or plot (string_search)
GET {{host}}/titles?q=dark knight

### Titles with all the words (exact_match_query)
GET {{host}}/titles?q=batman joker&match=exact

### Titles with most of the words, best first (best_match_query)
GET {{host}}/titles?q=batman joker&match=best&limit=5&offset=5

### Structured search (structured_string_search)
GET {{host}}/titles?person=heath ledger&character=joker

### One title, with genres and the first 10 cast members
GET {{host}}/titles/tt0468569

### Full cast, paged
GET {{host}}/titles/tt0468569/cast?limit=5&offset=5

### Similar titles (get_similar_titles, takes a few seconds)
GET {{host}}/titles/tt0468569/similar-titles?limit=5

### 404: no such title
GET {{host}}/titles/tt0000000

### 400: malformed id
GET {{host}}/titles/abc

### 400: match without q
GET {{host}}/titles?match=best

### 400: q and structured search together
GET {{host}}/titles?q=batman&title=joker


### ---- Persons ----

### Browse all persons, best known first
GET {{host}}/persons?limit=5

### Name search (name_search)
GET {{host}}/persons?q=keanu

### Structured search (structured_name_search): played Joker in a "dark knight" title
GET {{host}}/persons?title=dark knight&character=joker

### One person, with professions and name rating
GET {{host}}/persons/nm0000206

### Co-players, most shared titles first
GET {{host}}/persons/nm0000206/co-players

### 404: no such person
GET {{host}}/persons/nm0000000
